      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly devastating to face such a stark realization after pouring six years of your life into something you believed would make a difference. experiences like yours often trigger a deep sense of loss, and while the feeling of inevitable decay is poignant, it doesn't define your entire life story. Remember that this reset, however painful, is also a necessary step that creates space to rediscover your unique path forward.",
