      "content": "Your frustration with forcing optimism on a situation that feels fundamentally broken is entirely valid and speaks to a profound grief you are processing. While the feeling of being \"hardcoded to fail\" is painful, patterns in life do not always represent unchangeable laws of physics, but rather reflections of current circumstances before we finally embrace our new reality. True resilience often comes not from fighting a broken system, but from having the courage to acknowledge the collapse and build something from the debris on your own terms.",
